  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDB Support to High Technical Council - Latin American Laboratory for the Assessment of the Quality of Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Latin American Laboratory for the Assessment of the Quality of Education (LLECE) implements the Regional Comparative and Explanatory Study (ERCE) as one of its main projects. The ERCE is a large-scale study to measure learning achievements in the region.
The ERCE is characterized by its methodological rigor, aligning itself with the highest international standards for large-scale evaluations. One of them is to receive technical support from an advisory council made up of international experts with outstanding experience in the field of educational evaluation (High Technical Council - CTAN), who accompanies the development of the ERCE in all its phases, from the design to the implementation.
This FIT is for IDB&apos;s support of the High Technical Council for ERCE 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
